  "prefLabel": "He-P 2702.05 Milking Facility Change of Ownership",
  "priorExpiration": "2008-12-28",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-P 2702.05 Milking Facility Change of Ownership.\n\n(a) If a milking facility changes ownership, a producer permit shall not be issued until after completion of an inspection in accordance with He-P 2702.09.\n\n(b) A producer permit shall not be issued for a change of ownership unless the inspection results in:\n\n(1) A minimum score of 95 on a sanitary inspection; and\n\n(2) There is no violation of any critical items set forth in He-P 2702.10.\n\nSource. #7315, eff 7-1-00; ss by #9189, INTERIM, eff 7-1-08, EXPIRES: 12-28-08; ss by #9325, eff 11-21-08; ss by #12101, eff 2-3-17; ss by #13175, eff 3-2-21",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/he-p2700.html"
